    "description": "If you're a passionate Consultant Physician with drive and ambition, Wockhardt Hospitals Holdings Services in Pimpri-Chinchwad is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Wockhardt Hospitals Holdings Services:\nWockhardt Hospitals Holdings Services is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n• Provide high-quality patient care and maintain patient records\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n• Maintain accurate clinical documentation in electronic health records\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Attend continuing medical education programs and training\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Patient Care\n• Proficiency in BLS/ACLS\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n• Proficiency in ICD-10\n• Proficiency in CPT Codes\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n• Proficiency in NABH Standards\n• Proficiency in Infection Control\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Learning & development budget\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Wockhardt Hospitals Holdings Services!",
